    "v3": "G = M x max p counts an unused alphabet, so a label with image size m below M reads G of at least M / m (some sum label has conditional probability at least 1 / m in every used cell), and a label of image size 4 that is a homomorphism reads G = M with point masses; F1 at M = 64 on n = 19 has at most 20 classes. SR-6 now reads the image size (CD-9); L3 is unaffected because the shuffle preserves the image.",
